rest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s1","report_id":"dev_011","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s2","report_id":"dev_011","text":"We trained each model for 50 epochs with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s3","report_id":"dev_011","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.0003 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s4","report_id":"dev_011","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy of DistilBERT by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s5","report_id":"dev_011","text":"DistilBERT scores 27.1 points higher on IMDB than on SST-2 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s6","report_id":"dev_011","text":"As shown in Figure 1, on SST-2, DistilBERT obtains a accuracy of about 50%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s7","report_id":"dev_011","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s8","report_id":"dev_011","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 10, the loss of ResNet-18 is 0.737.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s9","report_id":"dev_011","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 2, the loss of VGG-16 is about 1.8.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s10","report_id":"dev_011","text":"Figure 3 shows the validation accuracy of BERT-base by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s11","report_id":"dev_011","text":"On SVHN, BERT-base obtains a validation accuracy of 57% (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s12","report_id":"dev_011","text":"On CIFAR-10, BERT-base obtains a validation accuracy of about 80%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s13","report_id":"dev_011","text":"BERT-base achieves about 80% validation accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s14","report_id":"dev_011","text":"Figure 4 shows the training loss.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s15","report_id":"dev_011","text":"Ours has a loss of 1.211 at epoch 1.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s16","report_id":"dev_011","text":"At epoch 3, the loss of BERT-base is 0.438.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_011_s17","report_id":"dev_011","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}